# <type>(<optional-scope>)!: <subject, max ~72 chars>
#
# Allowed types: feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
# Use "!" or a "BREAKING CHANGE:" footer to mark breaking changes.
#
# Body: explain WHY, not what (the diff already shows what).
# Wrap at ~72 chars. Reference docs that were updated together.
#
# Footers (optional):
#   Refs: <approval-id>, <ADR path>, <issue link>
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
#
# Examples:
#   feat(specs): add EARS template
#   fix(agent): correct broken link in INDEX
#   docs(workflow): clarify session-start order
#   refactor(operations)!: rename approval-queue archive section
#
# Configure once per clone:
#   git config commit.template .gitmessage
